    "detailed_description": "Daydreamy is an indie first-person 3D casual narrative adventure game that tells the story of Nela, a dreamy nine-year-old girl with a big imagination. The game starts when Nela is an adult and lives a boring and incomplete life, feeling that something is missing. But one day, during her move, she discovers her adventure diary from childhood, where she had written all the fantasies and adventures she imagined. From that moment on, the game alternates between Nela's life as a child, full of fantasies and adventures, and her adult life, in an attempt to recover her lost imagination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350770/extras/c5d4145d4f4e3f5f3a4faf4bb944f188.poster.avif?t=1720718144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350770/extras/c5d4145d4f4e3f5f3a4faf4bb944f188.webm?t=1720718144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350770/extras/c5d4145d4f4e3f5f3a4faf4bb944f188.mp4?t=1720718144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Daydreamy, the player explores the scenarios and participates in mini-games with different mechanics invented by Nela. The story is told in a mixture of Nela's real life and the imaginary worlds she invented as a child. In the game, childhood nostalgia is a recurring theme and the excitement of when everything felt new for the first time is felt.<br><br>Daydreamy invites players to immerse themselves in the story and explore Nela's imaginary world to help her reclaim her imagination.",
    "about_the_game": "Daydreamy is an indie first-person 3D casual narrative adventure game that tells the story of Nela, a dreamy nine-year-old girl with a big imagination. The game starts when Nela is an adult and lives a boring and incomplete life, feeling that something is missing. But one day, during her move, she discovers her adventure diary from childhood, where she had written all the fantasies and adventures she imagined. From that moment on, the game alternates between Nela's life as a child, full of fantasies and adventures, and her adult life, in an attempt to recover her lost imagination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350770/extras/c5d4145d4f4e3f5f3a4faf4bb944f188.poster.avif?t=1720718144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350770/extras/c5d4145d4f4e3f5f3a4faf4bb944f188.webm?t=1720718144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350770/extras/c5d4145d4f4e3f5f3a4faf4bb944f188.mp4?t=1720718144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Daydreamy, the player explores the scenarios and participates in mini-games with different mechanics invented by Nela. The story is told in a mixture of Nela's real life and the imaginary worlds she invented as a child. In the game, childhood nostalgia is a recurring theme and the excitement of when everything felt new for the first time is felt.<br><br>Daydreamy invites players to immerse themselves in the story and explore Nela's imaginary world to help her reclaim her imagination.",
    "short_description": "Explore the imaginary worlds of Nela in Daydreamy, the indie first-person narrative adventure that takes you back to those years when everything was possible. Discover how she lost her imagination and let yours soar. Are you ready to embark on a unique adventure?",
